イトってそういうことか","ts":"1624360064.200400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sbRd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47562cc5-de5a-4a13-b042-8623303415f9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ざっくり動く感じにはなっているのだけど、テストが全然書けていなくてな\n\u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EVnggXTUMAMvqNy?format=jpg\u0026amp;name=small\u003e","ts":"1624359976.199800","attachments":[{"fallback":"640x518px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EVnggXTUMAMvqNy?format=jpg\u0026name=small","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EVnggXTUMAMvqNy?format=jpg\u0026name=small","original_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EVnggXTUMAMvqNy?format=jpg\u0026amp;name=small"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YmW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4ad5a66-4d29-43c9-914e-b536d3c8e8c9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"autoload のスクリプトの先頭に `scriptversion 4` って書いてある","ts":"1624359870.199200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mYta"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24538e7b-f10a-4d8a-8143-38bc77cfc9fa","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"前も書いた通りそれリリースされたら乗り換えますw","ts":"1624359840.198800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yH/l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8600c0f1-e6c3-4646-b773-41ee73faf84d","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"lint のエラーがあるときに QuickFix 閉じててもエラー個所がわかって便利とか。","ts":"1624359808.198300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ajt=p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b07655eb-a440-41d1-81e6-1e1420d2f821","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"quickfix の位置がひと目でわかります！！おわり","ts":"1624359802.198100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false